{"4397780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Roll Together", "steam_appid": 4397780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4873950], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/ad8e96bbfbddf7930444ed2b3c92dc48.avif?t=1785008723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras_big/ad8e96bbfbddf7930444ed2b3c92dc48.webp?t=1785008723 width=1560 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are dead simple. The physics? Cruel. Your partner’s reaction time? Unreliable. Think you have what it takes to reach the bottom in one piece, or will you plunge into the abyss before the first turn?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/64da63abe26ed3333c063035e5107281.poster.avif?t=1785008723\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/64da63abe26ed3333c063035e5107281.webm?t=1785008723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/64da63abe26ed3333c063035e5107281.mp4?t=1785008723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/3c09acec4f4265694c5fc705128ddacc.avif?t=1785008723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras_big/3c09acec4f4265694c5fc705128ddacc.webp?t=1785008723 width=1560 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't drive this thing alone. One player commands the left wheel, the other rules the right. Every momentum shift requires instant communication. Communication leads to shouting. Shouting leads to falling. But hey, that's half the fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/7906d3e4d0e5702462cbb2169d55f3ce.poster.avif?t=1785008723\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/7906d3e4d0e5702462cbb2169d55f3ce.webm?t=1785008723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/7906d3e4d0e5702462cbb2169d55f3ce.mp4?t=1785008723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/6a7bae8fbfdbb2dee3515781da238fa6.avif?t=1785008723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras_big/6a7bae8fbfdbb2dee3515781da238fa6.webp?t=1785008723 width=1560 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get too attached to your seats. Our momentum-based physics engine ensures that every bump, wall-smash, and sudden brake has severe consequences. Hit an obstacle too hard, and watch your characters get violently launched out of the Roller via glorious <strong>Ragdoll Physics</strong>. You aren't just driving the Roller; you are trying to stay on top of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/5826685e7268bf31e57166b48a8312ee.poster.avif?t=1785008723\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/5826685e7268bf31e57166b48a8312ee.webm?t=1785008723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/5826685e7268bf31e57166b48a8312ee.mp4?t=1785008723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/c2f38b4eb1f50fb4bd35057876a2ee06.avif?t=1785008723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras_big/c2f38b4eb1f50fb4bd35057876a2ee06.webp?t=1785008723 width=1560 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos knows no distance. Grab a friend, share a keyboard, or plug in two controllers for that classic split-screen experience where you can physically nudge your friend when they mess up. Or just jump straight into Online Co-op and test if your friendship can survive the voice-chat panics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/b8509af48543a981d2adead9de59156d.poster.avif?t=1785008723\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/b8509af48543a981d2adead9de59156d.webm?t=1785008723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/b8509af48543a981d2adead9de59156d.mp4?t=1785008723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/e54f05fa4bd8bf2d6378ac35ef5d6cc6.avif?t=1785008723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras_big/e54f05fa4bd8bf2d6378ac35ef5d6cc6.webp?t=1785008723 width=1560 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling off a platform is inevitable, but who says you can't look fabulous while doing it? Earn coins as you play to unlock a chaotic wardrobe of hilarious outfits, wacky hats, and custom skins for your Roller. Trigger ridiculous emotes to dance, taunt, or high-five right on top of the Roller before you both plunge into the abyss once again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/90f5d75caa3c42aa44572059abb21415.poster.avif?t=1785008723\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/90f5d75caa3c42aa44572059abb21415.webm?t=1785008723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/90f5d75caa3c42aa44572059abb21415.mp4?t=1785008723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/a207743a0eca70f6cde12d4d820bdfc3.avif?t=1785008723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras_big/a207743a0eca70f6cde12d4d820bdfc3.webp?t=1785008723 width=1560 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tracks are relentless, packed with moving hazards, unforgiving gaps, and dizzying heights. But don't rage-quit just yet! Generous, well-placed <strong>Checkpoints</strong> mean that a devastating plunge won't erase your hard work. You will probably fall a lot but the next attempt is always just a split second away. 👀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397780/extras/250b